{
  "description": "A chat error answer returned before the stream opens (status, headers, JSON body) and the answer the Responses route gives: the same status, Retry-After and x-sie-error-code, and the same OpenAI error body, except that a param naming a chat field is renamed to the Responses field. Headers not listed under expect.headers are not asserted, except that expect.absent_headers must be missing.",
